        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francesca Annis, Jerome Benton, Steven Berkoff, Kristin Scott Thomas\n- Films and TV: Under the Cherry Moon, Lillie, BAFTA TV Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Francesca Annis won the 1979 BAFTA TV Award for Best Actress for the ITV serial \"Lillie\".\n- Francesca Annis was a six-time BAFTA TV Award nominee.\n- The film \"Under the Cherry Moon\" also stars Jerome Benton, Steven Berkoff, Kristin Scott Thomas, and Francesca Annis.\n- Jerome Benton was a former member of The Time.\n- \"Under the Cherry Moon\" was Kristin Scott Thomas's feature film debut.",
